	(text "CM5 supply: TPS61088 boost VSYS -> 5.03 V (always on while VSYS exists; the module PMIC does on/off)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "73ed1523-4a4f-4169-9f76-1868d7cde0c9")
	)
	(text "Ref: TI ZHCSDP8A sec. 9.2. fsw 600 kHz: RFREQ = 4(1/fsw - 89 ns*Vout/Vin)/23 pF = 270k (Vin 3.7 V).\nILIM = 1.19e6/140k = 8.5 A (min 7.2 A) > peak 6.1 A at Vin 3.0 V, 3 A out (Orange Pi CM5: 1.8 A max).\nVOUT = 1.204*(1+178k/56k) = 5.03 V: Orange Pi CM5 VBUS 4.75-5.25 V (PIN definition V1.1, JP1.77-87).\nCompensation (eq. 18-20, fc 9 kHz, Co 50 uF): R5 7.5k, C5 5.6 nF, C8 open. Soft start 47 nF = 11 ms. MODE open = PFM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8f347a4c-57af-440b-8478-fdf0c03f6ce2")
	)
	(text "5 V rail: TPS61089 boost VSYS -> 5.14 V (USB-A x2, keyboard, CAM-A, PD PP5V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.04 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f6b7085d-c82e-46a2-a102-dd850c28d773")
	)
	(text "Ref: TI SLVSD38C sec. 9.2. fsw ~575 kHz (RFREQ 270k, CFREQ 24 pF, tDELAY 86 ns). ILIM = 1.03e6/158k = 6.5 A (min 5.7 A)\n> peak 4.5 A at Vin 3.0 V / 2 A out. VOUT = 1.212*(1+324k/100k) = 5.14 V. Compensation fc 10 kHz: 8.2k + 6.8 nF.\nEN (VEN_H 1.2 V) = GPIO0_D5 (JP3.77, 1.8 V, default pull-up) with 100k pull-up to VCC_1V8_S3: on whenever the\nCM5 is on, software can cut it in suspend."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.04 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "48cfd299-ac2e-4204-be10-c53cc24231ca")
	)
	(text "LTE modem supply: TPS63020 buck-boost VSYS -> 3.75 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f91b029-73cd-462c-b5be-388e553cd918")
	)
	(text "Ref: TI SLVS916I sec. 8.2: L 1.5 uH, 3 x 22 uF out. VOUT = 0.5*(1+1M/154k) = 3.75 V (EM060K 3.135-4.4 V).\nEN (VIH 1.2 V) = GPIO0_C4 (JP3.83, 1.8 V; 100k pull-down: off until software enables). PS/SYNC high = forced PWM.\nQuectel asks 3 A cont./4 A peak; TPS63020 gives ~2 A in boost mode - 2 x 220 uF bulk on the M.2 sheet carry the bursts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dab62b69-a84f-4cf2-a186-69871f6caf67")
	)
	(text "AUX 3.3 V: TPS63020 buck-boost VSYS -> 3.31 V (AP6275P, USB hub, cameras)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
